ormation in evolutionary tree search methods based on maximum likelihood combining p-ECR and neighbor joining</article-title><source>BMC Bioinformatics</source><year>2008</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>S4</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Deng</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>Xu</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Improving the power for detecting overlapping genes from multiple DNA microarray-derived gene lists</article-title><source>BMC Bioinformatics</source><year>2008</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>S14</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zeng</surname><given-names>XQ</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>GZ</given-names></name><name><surname>Yang</surname><given-names>JY</given-names></name><name><surname>Yang</surname><given-names>MQ</given-names></name><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>GF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Dimension reduction with redundant gene elimination for tumor classification</article-title><source>BMC Bioinformatics</source><year>2008</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>S8</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>FX</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genetic weighted K-means algorithm for clustering large-scale gene expression data</article-title><source>BMC Bioinformatics</source><year>2008</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>S12</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wilkin</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name></pe